{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     nav-label — a navigation label with its leading "-" removed.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     A child item is marked in Ghost Admin by starting its label with "-", so
     the marker has to come off before the label is shown.

     Ghost's {{split}} DROPS empty segments, so "-Courses" splits to
     ["Courses"] — the leading marker disappears for free. The segments are
     then rejoined with "-", which is what keeps a legitimate internal dash
     intact: "-Data Cloud - Advanced" renders "Data Cloud - Advanced" rather
     than being truncated at the first dash.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
{{~#foreach (split label separator="-")}}{{#unless @first}}-{{/unless}}{{this}}{{/foreach~}}
